      "start_ms": 6626249,
      "end_ms": 6626949,
      "text": "拍刀成功"
    },
    {
      "index": 3578,
      "start_ms": 6626949,
      "end_ms": 6628950,
      "text": "狼人阵营屠神获胜"
    },
    {
      "index": 3579,
      "start_ms": 6628950,
      "end_ms": 6630070,
      "text": "好各位观众老师们"
    },
    {
      "index": 3580,
      "start_ms": 6630070,
      "end_ms": 6631950,
      "text": "这里是京城大师赛第23季"
